  * quote it in a bug report, a review or a discussion.

You may not, without written permission:
  * republish or reupload the mod or any part of it, anywhere, including a copy
    whose only change is a language;
  * distribute a modified version of it;
  * use its text, model, textures or sound in another project.

Contributed translations are covered by TERMS.md, which is part of this licence.

